WEBVTT

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:14.550
The time is now

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.020
to rule the realm

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.350
under the sky.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.580
Men!

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.090
The enemy...

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.550
Mitsu,

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:32.690
so it is you who have come.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.370
Ichihime-sama...

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:32.850
Nobu...

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:37.320
Is this a calamity you have wrought?

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:39.720
If we do nothing, this star...

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:42.630
No, the entire universe will be destroyed.

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.160
Ranmaru, I need to speak with you.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:04.860
What is it?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.750
You had a vision that declared
 Nobu the Destroyer-King, didn't you?

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.390
How did you know...

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.760
Don't underestimate me.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:25.790
So the true Savior-King 
is Arthur of the West?

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:27.140
I cannot say so

00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:29.770
with absolute certainty just yet.

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.680
And you?

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:34.360
What?

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.740
This land, now a wasteland...

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:39.660
Is this not also Nobu's doing?

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.110
Either way,

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:46.020
Ichihime-sama fell
 victim to the Destroyer-King.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:48.940
Nobunaga was trying to save her.

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:50.460
But he couldn't.

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:57.350
Would you follow him,
 even if he is the Destroyer-King?

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.540
That is what I have decided.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.240
Hey, it's time for lunch!

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.230
There we go.

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:18.650
Look. Pretty useful, huh?

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:22.690
Eat up and get stronger, guys.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:23.970
Here.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.090
Hey, wait your turn.

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:28.830
There's enough for everyone.

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:31.020
Eat up!

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:38.340
Chacha, please finish up.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:42.240
Hey, don't spill.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.250
Now, now. Don't cry.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.900
Didn't you come here to check 
on how everyone was doing?

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.850
There's still some left, don't worry.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:47.710
Yeah, that's what I intended.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:48.850
Then...

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.750
No, let's not.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:52.440
I think that if I show myself,

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.590
everyone will have a harder time of it.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:58.790
Well, people were surprised when 
I showed up because of how I look now.

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:01.480
I think you're doing better 
than me, Nobu-sama.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:05.270
I'm responsible for
 doing that to you, as well.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.740
What do you think you did to me?

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:13.500
Dad, Nobukatsu, and Ichi... 
I let all of them die.

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:17.590
I hurt and kill those around me.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:19.840
Yet I'm alive.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.660
Nobu-sama, remember what you told me.

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:26.170
People shouldn't just waste their lives.

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.040
There's so much they can do.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.050
And I'm alive.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.180
Monkey...

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.870
We are ready, Your Majesty.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:48.440
The time has come to 
manifest the Holy Grail.

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:50.280
Let's proceed to the next phase.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:57.610
Twelve chosen ones must come to me.

00:05:58.310 --> 00:05:59.930
That would be you all and...

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:15.670
The Perfecta, Your Majesty?

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:20.680
Et tu, Brute?

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:24.180
Now there remain but four more.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:28.620
Let us have the Chosen
 of the East fulfill their roles.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:31.120
So will we ask for their aid?

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:34.600
No, they will not have a choice.

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:37.060
If they will not acquiesce to my will...

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:41.060
I see.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:44.320
Summon Nobunaga, Hideyoshi, Himiko,

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:46.540
and Jeanne to my side.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.750
Your wish is my command, Savior-King.

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:52.500
Wait!

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:56.050
Why did you kill Caesar?

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.610
Why?

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:01.250
You would ask me that?

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:05.470
I simply dealt with a traitor who
 swore allegiance to the East yet again.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.230
What a foolish question.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.830
Once one becomes a Perfecta,

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.130
their memory and emotions will be sealed.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:16.990
Should you turn your blade
 against me for even a single instant,

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.200
your life will be forfeit.

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:21.630
What is your point?

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:26.200
My point is that I no longer have a way

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:30.000
to ask Charlemagne and Hannibal 
how they came to lose their lives.

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:36.220
King Arthur wishes to harness the 
Eastern ley lines to maximal effect.

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:40.780
The East is no longer
 capable of offering resistance.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:52.900
Nobu, you can bring... happiness...

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:55.560
and true peace to all.

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:58.760
So trust in your path...

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.240
Until the very... end.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:03.140
Nobu will bring true peace?

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:06.770
Ichihime believed it until the very end.

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.250
But he...

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:14.630
What true peace could be
 worth the cost of Ichihime's life?

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:18.020
Now that you are gone,

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:22.050
I can never know peace in my heart.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.710
What else?

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:29.210
We'll turn this war upside-down!

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:32.920
I will have all lands be mine,

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.390
including the East and West.

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:38.000
Yes, I will unite heaven and earth!

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:41.790
It was all a farce.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:20.190
Become a demon.

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:22.960
Did you kill him?

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:28.560
Go ahead! Pull the
 trigger and blow my arm off!

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:31.470
There are enough replacements.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:32.620
Monkey...

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:33.970
Mitsuhide.

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:36.180
What're you doing?

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:37.890
Monkey.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.030
What's wrong?

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:40.480
You're white as a sheet.

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:42.840
No...

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:49.390
I'm the one who killed Nobukatsu-sama.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.900
I killed Nobukatsu-sama so that Nobu

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:04.340
could fulfill his dream of world domination.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.260
Never mind.

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:24.990
Monkey.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:28.480
If you hadn't done it, I might have.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:36.520
If it had been Nobukatsu-sama 
who'd inherited the clan,

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:38.550
the Oda would have been destroyed already.

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:46.840
Is this cherry tree beyond saving?

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:48.770
Yeah.

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:50.980
It will never bloom again.

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:56.190
I've never forgotten about 
my little sister Asahi

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:57.920
and the other villagers who died.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.670
I will one day seek 
vengeance for their deaths.

00:11:01.230 --> 00:11:03.990
But for now, I have to follow Nobu-sama.

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.310
You...

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:08.160
We swore an oath, didn't we?

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:13.010
The three of us will change the world!

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:14.460
We can do this!

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:17.130
The word of a samurai cannot be revoked!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:23.630
Only Nobunaga can save this star.

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:28.520
I don't know anything about that whole 
Destroyer-King business... but...

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:33.470
If you want to call it quits

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:36.530
before he unifies heaven and earth,

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:39.290
I will kill you.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:41.180
Keep that in mind.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:12:00.070
<i>Brother, what will you have fill that bowl?</i>

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.970
<i>Will it be the happiness of the people</i>

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:05.920
<i>or the destruction of the world?</i>

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:08.860
What am I...

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:18.660
Nobunaga?

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:27.640
Ranmaru?

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:31.560
It is my turn to support you in your grief,

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.900
even if you are the Destroyer-King.

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:45.110
Even if my love remains unrequited,

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:49.550
I will give strength to my beloved.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:54.260
Even should my own life be at death's door...

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:07.760
Nobunaga?

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:10.770
Its name is the Bowl of Emptiness.

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:18.720
What is there is what is not.

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:21.430
To become fixated
 upon that is futility itself.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:26.910
I can only advance upon my own path!

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:32.370
Is it because the prophecy said
 Sir Nobunaga is the Destroyer-King?

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.280
That's not all.

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:36.840
But for some reason,

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:39.450
I cannot fathom Nobu's thoughts right now.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:44.530
Some things can become obscure 
when you are too close to them.

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:47.460
It can be important at times 
to scrutinize from a distance.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:52.320
I, also, have realized
 many things for the first time

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:55.460
upon leaving the West
 and coming to the East.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:57.360
Da Vinci-dono.

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:59.270
There is something I would like to ask you.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:01.470
Oh? What might that be?

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:04.380
Why did you come here?

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:06.210
What is your purpose?

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.540
My purpose?

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:12.210
To me, it appears as though
 our fates give you great joy...

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:17.090
Indeed, you are not too far from the truth.

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:19.990
I am an observer of events.

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:24.820
But I am attempting to intervene.

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:28.320
In your heart,

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:33.100
there indeed swirls emotions toward
 Sir Nobunaga that did not exist before.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.890
What impact might they
 have on you, Sir Nobunaga,

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.740
and the people around you,

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:44.140
not to mention this star and the world?

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:46.620
I am attempting to predict the future.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:49.850
Have you not attempted to 
predict the future of Arthur?

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:52.330
I have mentioned this before,

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:54.880
but I have yet to meet him.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:57.060
I have never been allowed to meet him.

00:14:57.780 --> 00:15:00.400
That is why I thought of 
meeting Sir Nobunaga instead.

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:02.800
That's why I came to this star.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:07.400
When Caesar met Arthur and returned, he said...

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:11.110
<i>This world is about to end.</i>

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.380
We must manifest the
 Holy Grail before that happens.

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:19.300
Will this world truly be saved

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:21.590
if Arthur manifests the Holy Grail?

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:33.010
The Devil, upright.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:36.340
This card has appeared
 without our intending it to.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:40.410
Is the Devil Sir Nobunaga or King Arthur?

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.310
Or you, perhaps?

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:47.910
Nobu believes we cannot 
avoid war with the West.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:50.530
But I find it difficult to believe

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:52.780
that further warfare
 will be of use to the East.

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:56.620
The prophecy has also stated that 
Sir Nobunaga is the Destroyer-King.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:00.790
I made Nobu into the Destroyer-King.

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:01.950
Oh?

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:06.970
Perhaps I should meet
 Arthur and confirm the truth.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:09.640
Since I do not possess any Regalia,

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:11.820
if I visited the West's stronghold,

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.960
it should not immediately result in bloodshed.

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:24.380
The future I predicted is beginning 
to take on a certain shape and form.

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:31.120
It seems the time has come 
to decide the final positions

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:32.820
for everyone involved.

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:36.920
Himiko-sama,

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.830
if you do not stop,
 your health will suffer.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:42.660
Do not concern yourself about me.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:45.230
More importantly, how are the ley lines?

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.680
The damage is severe.

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.400
Restoration is difficult.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:51.750
I will make another attempt.

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:53.010
Himiko-sama...

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:56.890
Just do as I say.

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:58.850
Yes, Your Highness.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:06.360
Even if it costs my life...

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:08.590
What's going on?!

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:09.910
Hideyoshi-sama!

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:11.280
Himiko! Hey!

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.500
Please stop Himiko-sama.

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.360
What are you doing?!

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:20.120
She said she will repair 
the damaged ley lines

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:22.840
in order to save the Star of the East.

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:25.370
She's sacrificing her own lifespan.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:26.380
Silence!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:31.420
I am just doing what I can for my betrothed.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:33.270
Do not interfere!

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:36.280
Hey, don't be an idiot!

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:38.580
What's going to happen if you die?

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:42.320
That is my heart's desire.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:44.620
You...

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:51.920
That's how you saved
 my life, too, isn't it?

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:53.710
Idiot.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:59.110
Take better care of yourself

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:01.710
until I can repay you for the favor.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:06.150
Coming from you,
 that brings me no comfort.

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:15.420
But this is my own path to walk.

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.930
Let me live out my life as I see fit.

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:21.390
Don't take it all on yourself, damn it...

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.810
I knew he would come.

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:37.270
The fool.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:42.270
But I don't dislike his 
idiotic sense of duty.

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:53.330
I am Akechi Mitsuhide!

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:56.600
It has been a while, Sir Mitsuhide.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:59.210
As you can see, I am unarmed!

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:03.610
I seek audience with King Arthur
 as the Oda clan's military strategist.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:07.950
If you had come with Nobunaga,

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.520
I would have struck
 you down without a word.

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:14.350
But since it is just you,
 who do not possess a Regalia...

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:21.510
King Arthur has heard of your 
prowess as a military strategist.

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:23.860
He would like to see you.

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.860
Now, allow me to take you to him.

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:38.050
My condolences regarding Lady Ichihime.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:42.500
I believe her death transpired soon after the

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:45.330
prophecy declared Nobunaga the Destroyer-King.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.980
The prophecy is one thing.

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:52.820
I wish to see things for myself,
 with my own eyes.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:55.490
Once you meet King Arthur,

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:58.410
even the dumbest fool
 will understand right away.

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:09.360
Sir Mitsuhide, Your Majesty.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.280
Well met.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:13.340
I will now take my leave.

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:19.550
Akechi Mitsuhide...

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:24.900
You have come here to
 confirm my true intentions,

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:26.530
have you not?

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:28.120
Yes.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.740
Just like you,

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:33.460
I desire peace for this world,

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.800
and only peace.

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:39.070
Then why did you invade the East?

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:43.740
You know more than anyone 
else why that was necessary.

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:48.660
I do not desire war.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:53.720
But I must stop the Destroyer-King,

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:56.990
for he has shed the
 blood of many in the East

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:58.320
and left its lands barren.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:03.890
The Savior-King has but one mission,

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:06.120
to manifest an eternal 
utopia in this world.

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:09.830
Yes, an earthly paradise.

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:11.110
Paradise...

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:12.780
Utopia...

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:14.910
In order to do so,

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:18.000
you must strike down Nobunaga

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:20.840
and become a loyal
 brother of the Round Table.

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:22.840
Strike down Nobunaga?

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:26.390
If you truly desire peace,

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:30.850
work with me to bring
 eternal peace to this world.

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:37.830
It will be done here at 
this temple, Palais Natura,

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:40.130
or Honnou...

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:43.130
The enemy...

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.210
...is at Honnou...

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:53.780
War is not the only way to live life.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:01.840
Open your eyes, Mitsuhide.

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:07.290
Father...

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:11.550
No, King Arthur.

00:22:11.960 --> 00:22:13.950
I will obey your will.

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:16.970
Nobu...

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:20.130
I... will...

00:22:21.600 --> 00:22:23.040
Mitsuhide-sama!

00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:26.540
Mitsuhide-sama has gone
 alone to King Arthur's Palais Natura!

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:27.810
What?!

00:22:31.940 --> 00:22:34.750
Mitsu... what are you doing?

00:24:11.520 --> 00:24:14.020
When do the flames of life burn most bright?

00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:16.990
I do not believe it is when 
they are about to die.

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:19.550
Now. Yes, it is now.

00:24:19.890 --> 00:24:21.460
Next time: The World.

00:24:21.950 --> 00:24:25.260
Shine and illuminate all, my betrothed!
